    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel Domain is a minimalist, medieval 4x game. Play cards to capture territories, play more cards to build in those territories to get access to better cards, play better cards to get a larger army, build castles to get access to powerful hero's, build improvements to pay for your upkeep. Pixel Domain can be played against an AI, online or hotseat multiplayer. Unlock new cards by playing challenges. Conquer the island or build a wonder to win.</p>",
